WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.403
-We're hanging out with
Joseph Gordon-Levitt now.

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:04.704
[ Cheers and applause ]
♪♪

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:08.974
It is time for Joe and I to do
the "Face It Challenge."

00:00:08.974 --> 00:00:10.343
Now, here's how it works.

00:00:10.343 --> 00:00:12.311
Each round, I'll draw a card,

00:00:12.311 --> 00:00:14.948
which will tell us
what face we both have to make.

00:00:14.948 --> 00:00:17.583
We'll look in our mirrors,
make our faces,

00:00:17.583 --> 00:00:19.786
and then reveal them on
the count of 3.

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:21.520
We'll stare at each other
for 10 seconds

00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:23.289
while trying to hold our faces.

00:00:23.289 --> 00:00:25.291
The first person to
crack a smile,

00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:27.961
laugh, or break the face loses.

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.863
Let's see what
our first face is.

00:00:29.863 --> 00:00:31.564
Here we go.

00:00:31.564 --> 00:00:36.169
Okay, we have to do the --
a bad driver's license photo.

00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.105 line:0%
Alright, now,
we'll take a moment

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.773 line:0%
and we'll make our faces
behind our mirrors.

00:00:40.773 --> 00:00:42.909 line:0%
A bad driver's license photo.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.845 line:0%
And on the count of 3,
we'll reveal.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:50.717 line:0%
1, 2, 3.

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:00.026 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:01:00.026 --> 00:01:05.465 line:0%
[ Ding ]
♪♪

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:06.966
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:10.502
Okay, this next face
we have to make --

00:01:10.502 --> 00:01:13.440
the world's happiest dog.

00:01:15.008 --> 00:01:17.477 line:0%
-These are good.
Your writers upped their game.

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:19.779 line:0%
-Yeah, the writers are
on fire, man.

00:01:19.779 --> 00:01:21.714 line:0%
The world's happiest dog.
Here we go.

00:01:21.714 --> 00:01:25.218 line:0%
Get ready.
-Okay. Okay.

00:01:25.218 --> 00:01:28.254 line:0%
-3, 2, 1.

00:01:32.358 --> 00:01:34.126 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:34.126 --> 00:01:35.661 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:35.661 --> 00:01:39.265 line:0%
You had a prop.
You had a stick -- finger stick.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.833
-Oh, yeah, man.
Was it a stick?

00:01:40.833 --> 00:01:42.368
I just thought it was
someone's hand.

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.904
I thought he was happy because
he was mangling a person.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:46.639
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:46.639 --> 00:01:48.674
-Rusty, where did you
find that hand?

00:01:48.674 --> 00:01:50.509
-[ Laughing ] Yeah.

00:01:50.509 --> 00:01:52.077
-Oh, this is a good one.
Alright, let's do another one.

00:01:52.077 --> 00:01:55.848
This one is dead eyes.

00:01:55.848 --> 00:01:57.416
-Dead eyes.
-Dead eyes.

00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:01.020 line:0%
-Like dead, like I'm playing
the corpse on "NCIS"?

00:02:01.020 --> 00:02:02.221 line:0%
-No, no, no, no, no.

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:04.656 line:0%
I think just, like --
There was that movie,

00:02:04.656 --> 00:02:09.529 line:0%
the roller coaster,
the Santa Claus roller coaster,

00:02:09.529 --> 00:02:11.797 line:0%
where -- "The Santa Express,"
maybe?

00:02:11.797 --> 00:02:13.599 line:0%
"Polar Express."
-Oh, yeah.

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.768 line:0%
-They didn't really figure out
the eyes in that one,

00:02:15.768 --> 00:02:18.203 line:0%
so all the people's eyes
were a little off.

00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:21.474 line:0%
So get in that headspace.

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.908 line:0%
-Okay, okay.

00:02:22.908 --> 00:02:26.980 line:0%
-You ready? 3, 2, 1.

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:32.718 line:0%
[ Laughs ]

00:02:32.718 --> 00:02:33.919 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]
♪♪

00:02:33.919 --> 00:02:37.723 line:0%
Just a little. Just a little.
-That's the face.

00:02:37.723 --> 00:02:39.258 line:0%
That was the face
all the kids had.

00:02:39.258 --> 00:02:40.927 line:0%
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:42.895 line:0%
You saw that film.
Alright, here we go.

00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:44.597 line:0%
Let's do the last one here,
final round.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:47.433 line:0%
This one is worth
a million points.

00:02:47.433 --> 00:02:48.768 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:48.768 --> 00:02:51.937 line:0%
-This is -- Oh, this is good.

00:02:51.937 --> 00:02:54.073 line:0%
Bass player feeling the groove.

00:02:54.073 --> 00:02:56.476 line:0%
-Hell yeah. All right.
-Bass face, basically.

00:02:56.476 --> 00:02:58.878 line:0%
Bass face.
Bass player feeling the groove.

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:05.218 line:0%
3, 2, 1.

00:03:05.751 --> 00:03:14.960 line:0%
♪♪

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.996 line:0%
[ Ding ]

00:03:19.565 --> 00:03:23.236 line:0%
-The accompaniment.
The accompaniment helps.

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.405 line:0%
-Joseph Gordon-Levitt,
everybody!

00:03:26.405 --> 00:03:30.742 line:0%
Season 2 of his YouTube series,
"Create Together,"

00:03:30.742 --> 00:03:32.245 line:0%
premieres April 22nd.

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:33.246 line:0%
Get involved with that.

